<title>ISRAEL: Netanyahu departs for United States.</title>
<headline>Netanyahu departs for United States.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu left on Monday for the United States where he will meet President Bill Clinton, a government official said.</p>
<p>Netanyahu was expected to brief Clinton on the latest Middle East peace moves including efforts to renew talks between Israel and Syria.</p>
</text>
